    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L14-ACTIVITY-017",
      "SourceSection": "14.2: Info Gap: More Polynomials",
      "SourceExcerpt": "When you have enough information, share the problem card with your partner, and solve the problem independently.",
